tor":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-04-23T22:52:23Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T14:14:35Z","closed_at":"2026-04-28T14:14:35Z","assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nWith frame synthesis:\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7-dev5 or `master` (1c8cc9e7e2c9a083cf726e74193d3824fb38cda4)\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.6.1, or 4.7-dev1 through 4.7-dev4\n\nWith space warp:\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7-dev3 or later, including `master` (1c8cc9e7e2c9a083cf726e74193d3824fb38cda4)\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.6.1, 4.7-dev1 or 4.7-dev2\n\n### System information\n\n- Android - Samsung Galaxy XR - Adreno 740\n- Android - Meta Quest 3 - Adreno 740\n\n### Issue description\n\nStarting with Godot 4.7-dev5, Godot will crash when using either `XR_EXT_frame_synthesis` (which is supported in Godot itself) or `XR_FB_space_warp` starting from Godot 4.7-dev3 (which is supported by the godot_openxr_vendors extension)\n\nI've tracked this down to the `on_pre_render()` virtual function now running at least once before  `on_main_swapchains_created()`, which will mean that neither implementation has been able to do all the preparation needed for frame synthesis or space warp\n\n~~I'm not entirely sure _why_ this has changed. I've bisected it to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219, but I just don't see anything in that PR that should cause this outcome~~\n\nThe change in order is caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116220, which breaks with space warp right away, but for some reason with frame synthesis it doesn't start crashing until after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219.\n\nI've opened PRs that fix this on the OpenXR side, by making fewer assumptions about the order that things will happen:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118901\n- https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/pull/487\n\nSo, that's one option, and we probably should merge those anyway since they are somewhat safer. But it would be good to figure out why the order changed, because other GDExtensions could potentially depend on it\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the [Meta SpaceWarp Sample](https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/4169) on a Meta Quest device\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Meta SpaceWarp Sample](https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/4169)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118902/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}